<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1815</h1><p class="ref-lede">1815 in world history: 47 events, 19 births, 15 deaths, 3 works, 15 states founded and 14 that came to an end. 1,124 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
